Subject: Re: CN analysis with Nsp+Sty chips with pooled reference? (Was: Re: Aroma.affymetrix package: annotate copy number estimate with SNPs and Gene names)
Message-ID: <Vo0QBrx9_6Y.byVoLqL3vGEJ@aroma-affymetrix.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/aroma-affymetrix/c/Vo0QBrx9_6Y/m/byVoLqL3vGEJ>
